# 仓库自带 binaries.tar.gz(75MB,< 100MB 单文件限制以内),直接提交
# setup_binaries.py 启动时会自动解压到本目录,然后删除压缩包
# assets/bin/binaries.tar.gz
#
# 解压后产生的实际二进制也保留在工作树里(下次 build 用),
# 但不强制提交 — 它们由压缩包生成,版本管理跟着 tar.gz 走
# assets/bin/aria2c.exe
# assets/bin/ffmpeg.exe
# assets/bin/ffprobe.exe
# assets/bin/*.dll
#
# 临时文件还是忽略(setup_binaries.py 跑下载时残留的 zip)
assets/bin/_aria2.zip
assets/bin/_ffmpeg.zip
assets/bin/_*.tmp
# 但保留 .gitkeep 让目录结构存在
!assets/bin/.gitkeep

# OS
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
desktop.ini

# Editor
.vscode/
.idea/
*.swp
*.swo

# Logs
*.log